{"id":"665039","name":"刀豆焖排骨","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/665039/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"刀豆(扁豆)","amount":"500g"},{"name":"排骨","amount":"400g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"2瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"刀豆洗净切段备用。","img":"images/665039/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨洗净用少许生粉、生抽腌制20分钟。","img":"images/665039/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头切片。","img":"images/665039/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中倒入适量油，下蒜头爆香。","img":"images/665039/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下排骨翻炒一下。","img":"images/665039/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再下入刀豆，翻炒一下。","img":"images/665039/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"撒入盐。","img":"images/665039/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加蚝油。","img":"images/665039/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撒入辣椒粉，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/665039/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入一碗清水，中小火焖煮20分钟左右即可。","img":"images/665039/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}